# Professional profiles

A profession is a versioned manifest in the catalog or a signed package. Do not add it as a closed enum or as a second application.

- Keep identity separate from the figure and the voice. The active session must show the role and say it is an AI professional.
- Install, update, activate, roll back, and remove through `ProfileRegistry`.
- Bundled starters install only in simulation. Production requires `verifyManifest`.
- An update that adds a permission throws `permission_grant_required` until that permission is accepted.

```ts
if (added.some((item) => !accepted.includes(item))) throw new ProfileError('permission_grant_required', 'Accept the new permissions.', 409);
```

Do not rebuild the console to switch profiles.
